{"name":"Astro Purple","hex":"#6d5acf","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"astro","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Clipping of astrology.","Clipping of astroturf."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/astro"},{"term":"purple","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour between red and blue; violet, though often closer to magenta.","Any non-spectral colour on the line of purples on a colour chromaticity diagram or a colour wheel between violet and red."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a purple hue.","Not predominantly red or blue, but having a mixture of Democrat and Republican support."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/purple"}],"entries":[{"title":"Astro (South Korean band)","blocks":[{"text":"Astro is a South Korean boy band formed by Fantagio. The group is composed of four members: MJ, Jinjin, Cha Eun-woo, and Yoon San-ha. Astro was originally a sextet; Rocky departed from the group on February 28, 2023, and Moonbin died on April 19, 2023. They debuted on February 23, 2016, with the extended play Spring Up and were subsequently named as one of the best new K-pop acts of 2016 by Billboard."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Astro_in_Sept_2017_%28derived%29.jpg/330px-Astro_in_Sept_2017_%28derived%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astro_(South_Korean_band)","wikidata":"Q23004252"},{"title":"Purple","blocks":[{"text":"Purple is a color similar in appearance to violet light. In the RYB color model historically used in the arts, purple is a secondary color created by combining red and blue pigments. In the CMYK color model used in modern printing, purple is made by combining magenta pigment with cyan pigment, black pigment, or both. In the RGB color model used in computer and television screens, purple is created by mixing red and blue light in order to create colors that appear similar to violet light. According to color theory, purple is considered a cool color."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg/330px-Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple","wikidata":"Q3257809"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png/500px-Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png/500px-Astro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Astro at their showcase for Dream Part.01","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAstro_at_%22Dream_Part._01%22_Showcase.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/500px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/1280px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg/500px-Astro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"From left to right: Moonbin, Jinjin, Rocky, and Sanha at the HallyuPopFest 2022 in London","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAstro_at_the_HallyuPopFest_London_2022_event.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikiped